      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING LEE (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at Q Lakeside following on from a third place finish (30.60) there the start prior. Has a strong winning record here at this journey. Hard to knock her form from this box, unbeaten in five starts. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. ZIPPING LIPA (4) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish second, beaten 0.8 lengths, (30.67) at Q Lakeside. Can feature again. BACKCREEK BENNY (8) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (30.61) at Q Lakeside. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Will give a great sight again. CANYA DYNAMITE (6) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
